1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,350
And God said,

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:08,689
Let there be a firmament
in the midst of the waters,

3
00:00:08,889 --> 00:00:13,876
and let it divide the waters
from the waters.

4
00:00:20,376 --> 00:00:23,126
And God made the firmament,

5
00:00:23,426 --> 00:00:28,176
and divided the waters
which were under the firmament

6
00:00:28,476 --> 00:00:32,726
from the waters
which were above the firmament:

7
00:00:33,726 --> 00:00:35,976
and it was so.

8
00:00:41,976 --> 00:00:45,226
And God called
the firmament Heaven.

9
00:00:49,726 --> 00:00:54,976
And the evening and the morning
were the second day.
